## Django Templates Guidelines

### Template Usage

- Use Django templates for rendering HTML and DRF serializers for JSON responses
- Create reusable template components
- Use template inheritance for consistent layouts
- Implement proper template organization

### Admin Interface

- Customize Django admin interface for content management
- Implement admin actions for bulk operations
- Use admin filters and search functionality
- Create custom admin views when needed

### Template Structure

- Organize templates in app-specific directories
- Use base templates for common layouts
- Implement proper template context
- Handle template errors gracefully

### Security

- Use template escaping for user-generated content
- Implement CSRF tokens in forms
- Validate template variables
- Use safe template filters appropriately

### Performance

- Optimize template rendering
- Use template caching when appropriate
- Minimize template complexity
- Use template fragments for dynamic content
